      "status_terms_zh": [
        "晕眩"
      ],
      "summary_en": "Tosses a bomb to target area that sticks to units that come near it (prioritizes Champions). It detonates after 3 seconds, dealing area of effect damage. If a Time Bomb is detonated early by another Time Bomb, it also stuns enemies.",
      "summary_zh": "将一颗炸弹扔向目标区域，炸弹会附着在靠近它的单位身上（英雄优先）。炸弹会在3秒后爆炸，造成范围魔法伤害。如果炸弹被另一颗定时炸弹给提前引爆，那么还会使敌人晕眩。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1307867:4008679"
      ]
    },
